A dark, rain-soaked cyberpunk cityscape at night. Towering skyscrapers with neon signs reflected in wet streets. In the foreground, a young Asian woman with black hair in two ponytails with pink and green streaks, one glowing blue cybernetic eye, wearing a dark leather jacket. She stands in a narrow alley, her silhouette partially dissolved into digital glitch artifacts — pixels scattering from her body like she's fading between reality and code. Behind her, the dim glow of a rainbow neon sign reading "GWELIO". The color palette is dominated by deep blues, electric cyan, hot pink neon, and rain. Cinematic composition, moody noir atmosphere, high detail, concept art style for a tabletop RPG book cover.
